            "detailed_description": "<h1>联系交流</h1><p>如果您无法正常进入steam社区交流，<br>欢迎加入我们的交流QQ群：933067442</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689070/extras/db96331177bf901726be69d1777fe400.avif?t=1667031574\" width=600 height=290 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2>After the unification war of the Kingdom, rebels appeared in the Capital.<br>Although the rebellion was quickly suppressed, there were still a number of remnants at large.<br>Two years later, the main character of the game, Asyula, received an order to pursue the leader of remnant rebellious forces, Awillou.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team is composed of 2 characters with a total of 3 operational roles.<br></li><li>Exploration of field maps, interaction with NPCs and receiving tasks, transactions in stores, battles in the field when encountering enemy.<br></li><li>Turn-based combat RPG, characters can choose various operations in a battle in their turns respectively, without time limit.<br></li><li>SkillLink command: you can edit the SkillLink skills for each characters, the proper use of the SkillLink may reverse the situation.<br></li><li>Weapon proficiency: all weapons have proficiencies. Before a new weapon brings into play normally, it must be used for a period of time, or it may be no more than a skilled low-level weapon.<br></li><li>Supporter: Triggering special NPCs' events increases favorable impression to obtain their trusts and get their supports in the battle.<br></li><li>StarStone magic: you can buy or collect all kinds of [StarStone] from stores or in the fields. Equipting different StarStones will enable you use different magics.<br></li><li>The battle randomly triggers a variety of bonus. Carefully change the action orders can help you get the advantage of Bonus.<br></li><li>Environmental effects &amp; Traps in the field: there are different environmental effects and traps in the wild which are needed to deal with carefully!<br></li><li>32 achievements are available in the game.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689070/extras/db96331177bf901726be69d1777fe400.avif?t=1667031574\" width=600 height=290 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2>After the unification war of the Kingdom, rebels appeared in the Capital.<br>Although the rebellion was quickly suppressed, there were still a number of remnants at large.<br>Two years later, the main character of the game, Asyula, received an order to pursue the leader of remnant rebellious forces, Awillou.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team is composed of 2 characters with a total of 3 operational roles.<br></li><li>Exploration of field maps, interaction with NPCs and receiving tasks, transactions in stores, battles in the field when encountering enemy.<br></li><li>Turn-based combat RPG, characters can choose various operations in a battle in their turns respectively, without time limit.<br></li><li>SkillLink command: you can edit the SkillLink skills for each characters, the proper use of the SkillLink may reverse the situation.<br></li><li>Weapon proficiency: all weapons have proficiencies. Before a new weapon brings into play normally, it must be used for a period of time, or it may be no more than a skilled low-level weapon.<br></li><li>Supporter: Triggering special NPCs' events increases favorable impression to obtain their trusts and get their supports in the battle.<br></li><li>StarStone magic: you can buy or collect all kinds of [StarStone] from stores or in the fields. Equipting different StarStones will enable you use different magics.<br></li><li>The battle randomly triggers a variety of bonus. Carefully change the action orders can help you get the advantage of Bonus.<br></li><li>Environmental effects &amp; Traps in the field: there are different environmental effects and traps in the wild which are needed to deal with carefully!<br></li><li>32 achievements are available in the game.</li></ul>",
